        "call": "Fetch the same official SNAP table's recent reference-class history.",
        "result": "Official Persons values were 42,180,523 in February 2025, 42,193,855 in March, 42,353,149 in April, 42,248,301 in May, 42,084,880 in June, 42,012,830 in July, 41,836,900 in August, and 41,633,090 in September."
      },
      {
        "kind": "tool",
